      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p>For container growing, a quality bagged "organic potting mix" amended with your own compost (about 20–25% by volume) and a light dose of lime is a perfectly good shortcut — Maine's native ground is the one place you should not cut corners.</p>
  </section>

